SY_TALK("pKhgNmXu22Q",[[2,["Before we begin, I would like to introduce myself"]],[6,["to those of you in the room."]],[8,["My name is Barbara Schuler and I do a radio program"]],[12,["on a station from Monterrey called Discovery"]],[17,["which is usually on Wednesdays from 1 to 2:30,"]],[21,["and is going to be now on Thursdays to 11:30 to 1 o’clock."]],[26,["And it’s my privilege to be here"]],[29,["to do a taped interview for my listeners."]],[35,["So for the listeners I would like to say"]],[37,["that we are at Kennolyn Campgrounds in Santa Cruz"]],[40,["and this is an interview with Her Holiness Mataji."]],[45,["Mother, today there are many, many things said about Sahaja Yoga,"]],[49,["about Your philosophy"]],[51,["and very little was said about who You are as a person."]],[56,["And I thought it would be good to start out with some,"]],[58,["few questions about who You are, who were You as a child,"]],[62,["what people influenced You,"]],[64,["what brought You to the place You are today"]],[67,["as a Luminous Being sitting before me and before us?"]],[71,["I am a very ancient being – that problem is like this, you see?"]],[78,["And to… what can I tell you about Myself?"]],[81,["I just don’t know what part will interest you,"]],[85,["but only thing I can say"]],[90,["that I was born with this understanding and awareness"]],[96,["that I have to find out a method"]],[100,["by which I could give en mass Realization to people."]],[105,["I was a Realized soul, of course."]],[107,["I knew all about it from My very childhood."]],[111,["But the problem was that how to make many people get it,"]],[116,["because if one person gets it"]],[119,["or one person has it,"]],[121,["if one person is an incarnation,"]],[124,["people don’t understand it."]],[126,["Not only that but they may even try to destroy such a person."]],[130,["That’s what happened to all the saints who came on this earth."]],[133,["Christ was crucified,"]],[135,["Mohammed Sahib was given poison."]],[138,["Because they were ignorant."]],[140,["They did not know what it was, what was He saying."]],[144,["So it was important first of all"]],[146,["to find out a method how to give them"]],[151,["en mass Realization."]],[154,["And from that angle I just thought"]],[158,["that this is why I am on this earth"]],[160,["and I have to do this job,"]],[163,["for which I wanted to study about human beings."]],[167,["I took My birth in a Christian family"]],[170,["and that too a family which was Protestant family,"]],[174,["because I felt that"]],[178,["Protestants are fanatics but very sophisticated."]],[185,["And they rationalize everything to such an extent"]],[188,["that nobody can see beyond it."]],[190,["So I better take My birth in them."]],[193,["And My father and mother had already taken birth"]],[196,["whom I had chosen as My parents."]],[200,["They were great people, realized souls"]],[203,["and specially My father"]],[205,["was a person who knew why I was on this earth."]],[209,["Even My mother knew about it."]],[213,["So a special rapport was between them and Me"]],[217,["and they could understand"]],[219,["why I was busy meditating"]],[223,["or finding out about how to give Realization to others."]],[228,["Then I would say My father who was a very learned man,"]],[231,["who knew about fourteen languages,"]],[233,["who translated Quran-e-Sharif into Hindi,"]],[236,["who was a member of the Constituent Assembly,"]],[239,["He made our Constitution."]],[241,["Also he was the only Christian to be elected in those days."]],[246,["And then My mother was a honors in Mathematics,"]],[250,["all very well-educated and nice people."]],[255,["They dedicated their life"]],[257,["to the cause of freedom of India."]],[260,["And I also felt that, that was very important,"]],[263,["because if we are not free"]],[266,["we cannot do anything on religious basis."]],[268,["There’s one thing is to be free from this level."]],[272,["And that’s how I also helped them a lot"]],[277,["and our whole family suffered a lot."]],[279,["And I went through terrible times, terrible times,"]],[282,["since very young age."]],[284,["I was with Mahatma Gandhi also"]],[286,["because he liked Me very much as a child."]],[288,["So I stayed on with him"]],[290,["then I used to come back to study, again go back to him."]],[293,["He used to call Me “Nepali”"]],[295,["because My face is a Nepali face."]],[297,["And he used to talk to Me"]],[299,["as if he is talking to his grandmother sometimes."]],[301,["He was very sweet and he was a very sweet man"]],[304,["– extremely sweet person to children -"]],[307,["very strict with himself and strict with others elderly people."]],[311,["But with children he was very, very sweet and kind"]],[317,["and would try to learn from children lot of things."]],[321,["It was surprising how he understood"]],[323,["that there’s lot of wisdom with the children sometimes"]],[327,["than with the older people who are mixed up."]],[333,["Now we got our independence"]],[337,["and we had a very bad setback"]],[340,["because of the partition we had in our country."]],[345,["And I was studying in Lahore Medical College there"]],[349,["because I wanted to know about medicine"]],[351,["what these people call such and such thing,"]],[355,["because I knew all this but, I knew about the body,"]],[357,["I knew about everything, the"]],[360,["what you call the complete nervous system"]],[363,["but I did not know what was the vocabulary attached to it,"]],[366,["so I studied there for two years."]],[368,["Now after that, this war broke out,"]],[370,["so I had to discontinue with My studies"]],[373,["and My parents wanted Me to get married."]],[375,["And then I found that My marriage was important,"]],[379,["I agreed to marry"]],[381,["and I married this gentleman, Mr. C.P. Srivastava."]],[385,["Then during all that time,"]],[388,["My only pastime or the full-time work"]],[393,["was to find out about human beings,"]],[395,["what’s the problem they have,"]],[397,["how they avoid reality,"]],[400,["how they shun it, how they run away from it,"]],[403,["what are their problems,"]],[405,["how are they seeking, what do they have to offer,"]],[411,["what will they accept, how to handle them."]],[413,["It was quite a intricate question."]],[415,["Every person provided a new sample of problems"]],[419,["and I had to fight it out."]],[421,["In a way that it was a system which I knew how to do it,"]],[426,["because to enter into somebody subtly,"]],[429,["to understand the problems of the Kundalini –"]],[432,["you can go into the journey and find out about a person."]],[437,["And then I found out"]],[438,["the permutations and combinations of their problems."]],[441,["So like, it is like, you can say, that, like periodic tables."]],[445,["You had to divide them into three, then into seven,"]],[448,["then into their permutations and combinations."]],[451,["So you can imagine - three into seven, raised to power eternity."]],[454,["It was like that."]],[456,["But doesn’t matter! It worked out and"]],[461,["in the year 1970,"]],[466,["on the 5th of May,"]],[468,["I was little bit hesitant at that time."]],[472,["I thought I should wait but certain circumstances"]],[474,["made Me to open the last center."]],[479,["And when I opened the last center,"]],[483,["it started working with others, it went on en mass scale."]],[487,["But still I gave Realization only to"]],[490,["one lady who came to My house."]],[492,["I tried if it works out with her."]],[496,["And she, I gave her Realization,"]],[498,["by touching her centers one by one"]],[502,["- six centers -"]],[503,["and then bringing out the Kundalini on top of the head."]],[506,["- What does it mean to open the last center?","- The Sahasrara?"]],[510,["Last center is the center which is the limbic area;"]],[515,["where is the seat of all the seven centers."]],[518,["It’s all integration there."]],[520,["So far, everybody who has come"]],[522,["- like Christ has come on this center,"]],[524,["what you call the Agnya Chakra,"]],[525,["or Krishna has come on this center which is the Vishuddhi Chakra."]],[529,["Like that they have been appearing on every center of ours"]],[534,["giving us a new dimension to our awareness."]],[537,["And that’s how our awareness has improved to this extent"]],[541,["and now the time is for you to get your Absolute,"]],[545,["to get your Spirit,"]],[549,["that your Spirit must shine into your attention,"]],[553,["that you should have your Self-Realization,"]],[559,["that you should have your second birth."]],[561,["That’s the time! And that is only possible if baptism,"]],[565,["the real baptism works out – real, not artificial,"]],[569,["somebody coming and putting the hand on your head and saying,"]],[572,["“Now you are baptized”.  That’s not the way."]],[574,["But it is a real thing that happens that you start feeling"]],[577,["the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost coming out of you."]],[582,["So then I started giving first of all Realization"]],[587,["without confronting any kind of a position or anything."]],[590,["I started with one lady, then I went ahead with it."]],[594,["Then the first twelve people got Realization."]],[597,["Then I was very happy"]],[599,["because en mass Realization has started."]],[602,["Then gradually it started working out."]],[605,["I went to Indian villages."]],[607,["I thought they are better, simple people,"]],[609,["first work on the simpler people. And they got Realization."]],[612,["Now we have thousands of people in the villages"]],[615,["who have got Realization."]],[617,["They have dropped out all their bad habits."]],[619,["They have become very creative."]],[621,["They are doing very well. They are very happy people."]],[624,["And they are experts."]],[626,["So many of them are experts I can say in India now,"]],[629,["whom we call as Sahaja Yogi,"]],[631,["may be in thousands."]],[632,["Some are working in the villages,"]],[634,["some are working in some cities."]],[636,["So we have lots of people now in India, who can do this job."]],[640,["This all happened since 1970?"]],[643,["- I started it.","- [So You started]..."]],[645,["I have a question that’s important to me"]],[649,["and to many people who are searching for something as they think,"]],[654,["perhaps what you call Self Realization"]],[657,["or Sahaja Yoga or something."]],[660,["We, some of us don’t know exactly what it is."]],[663,["And we find that there are many teachers."]],[666,["How do we recognize those teachers"]],[669,["that You might call fraudulent from the real ones?"]],[672,["It’s so difficult because they all seem to be able to"]],[675,["inspire us in certain ways and give us experiences."]],[678,["How do we know who is teaching something that’s true"]],[683,["and who is being deceptive?"]],[685,["First and foremost thing is:"]],[687,["anybody who lives on your earnings is not a guru."]],[692,["A guru will never live on the earnings of his disciples."]],[697,["But here there are people who have big palaces,"]],[700,["bought aircrafts and cars and this."]],[703,["I mean, this is something one should understand."]],[705,["It’s so, so open to you to understand."]],[710,["I mean, I cannot understand more obvious thing that this one is"]],[715,["that it’s a parasitic living."]],[717,["And you cannot have a parasites as your gurus."]],[720,["They can be parasites but not your gurus."]],[723,["That’s one of the things. And if you can…"]],[726,["I mean, you can retain some people, you know?"]],[729,["If you want because you are rich people, you can retain some."]],[732,["That’s a different point. But you cannot have them as gurus."]],[735,["Guru has to be a higher personality, you see?"]],[738,["Now you have seen Christ was such a great incarnation."]],[743,["He didn’t take any money from anyone."]],[745,["He was a carpenter’s son and He used to do carpentry Himself"]],[749,["and He lived like a modest man."]],[751,["He never lived with big cars and big houses. It’s not necessary"]],[755,["because such a person is Himself, He is a very big king, you see,"]],[759,["like a big emperor."]],[761,["He doesn’t need anything, an emperor doesn’t need anything"]],[764,["because nothing can give him comfort"]],[767,["except that He Himself is in complete comfort."]],[770,["So such a person doesn’t want anything."]],[772,["So you must see that such a person has no needs of comfort at all."]],[777,["He can sleep on the grounds, he can sleep anywhere."]],[780,["Now, in this life,"]],[783,["I should say I come from a quite a wealthy family"]],[786,["or married to another wealthy man, you can say that way,"]],[789,["according to your own relative ideas."]],[792,["But to Me,"]],[796,["I can sleep anywhere. I have no problem."]],[798,["I have no problem of food,"]],[800,["no problem of sleeping anywhere, no comfort."]],[802,["And I find it is beyond My self-respect"]],[806,["to live on the earnings of others. It’s not proper."]],[809,["But you are My children;"]],[810,["supposing now you bring a flower to Me or something, it’s all right."]],[814,["But I can’t have a palace out of your money and all those things."]],[818,["It’s absurd, absolutely absurd!"]],[819,["So this is one thing one should know that it pampers our ego,"]],[823,["that we can purchase our guru,"]],[826,["we can purchase our Self-Realization."]],[828,["You see, this is a very subtle pampering."]],[831,["And that’s how people accept, you see?"]],[833,["They don’t want to accept a person who says,"]],[837,["“You cannot offer anything.”  It’s too much for them."]],[840,["Or maybe that, secondly, could be that people think"]],[844,["that if you pay something then you get attached to it,"]],[848,["you go through it whatever it is."]],[850,["Say you have paid for a ticket"]],[853,["and you find that the whole play is horrid, you can’t bear it,"]],[856,["but you have to go through it because you have paid for it."]],[858,["That’s a human nature, you see?"]],[860,["That’s a human nature. I have seen that they do it."]],[862,["And that’s what it works out."]],[864,["But this is very gross level, I’m telling you."]],[867,["But another should be that in these modern times it is promised"]],[871,["that you will become prophets."]],[874,["You have to become prophets."]],[876,["So you must see have you become prophets out of these?"]],[880,["Is... easiest is to see the disciples of this man,"]],[883,["any XYZ who says he is a guru."]],[886,["Now what is happening to the disciple? Is he a free person?"]],[889,["Has he got any knowledge?"]],[891,["Has he got any mastery?"]],[893,["What has he achieved by being with that person?"]],[895,["Now, you have seen here there are Sahaja Yogis."]],[897,["One better than the other!"]],[899,["You talk to them, they are knowledge."]],[902,["Some of them have met Me only for, say, eight day or so."]],[905,["They have become knowledge."]],[907,["So what have they achieved you should say."]],[909,["What is their style of life, their pattern of life, how they behave?"]],[913,["And there cannot be any privacy about it,"]],[916,["you see, like mafia -"]],[917,["you don’t tell that and you don’t say that"]],[919,["and you shouldn’t do that."]],[921,["Of course, in Sahaja Yoga"]],[923,["the truth is exposed gradually,"]],[926,["but it is not like this that if you give some money, nobody knows."]],[930,["Everybody knows everything in Sahaja Yoga, you see?"]],[933,["Now supposing we have to build an ashram, say for example."]],[937,["All right, you build your ashram, you collect your money,"]],[939,["do what you like and know about it. I have nothing to do with it."]],[942,["Also among yourself you should know how you got the money,"]],[945,["how you spent it, what is the expense and all that."]],[947,["Because ashram you can pay for"]],[950,["but not for your Realization."]],[953,["And this is one thing is very important,"]],[956,["that what you get out of it is important,"]],[959,["that you should become a prophet."]],[962,["Have you become a prophet?"]],[965,["Then, thirdly, you must know that if","you are going from one to another,"]],[968,["what we call guru shopping business"]],[970,["that means you have not found it."]],[971,["Otherwise, you would just settle down."]],[973,["But some people are so weak that they do settle down with one"]],[977,["and are finished with them."]],[979,["You must always see the people"]],[981,["who go to these gurus, what have they got."]],[984,["Have they got their transformation?"]],[988,["Because this is the age of transformation."]],[991,["Mataji, what about teachers or gurus who produce miracles?"]],[996,["You go to a guru"]],[998,["who materialize something out of the air and say, “This is divine”."]],[1001,["That’s a very serious question."]],[1003,["This is all jugglery. It’s all jugglery."]],[1005,["And also, you see, now supposing somebody says,"]],[1007,["“I produce a diamond”."]],[1009,["Now these people come from India."]],[1011,["Why don’t they solve the financial problem of India?"]],[1019,["Secondly, you see, at every point they can be challenged."]],[1023,["You should say that, \"Then, all right\"..."]],[1025,["One gentleman came to Me; he said that, “He gave me a diamond.”"]],[1027,["I said, “Why you? How many diamonds you have?”"]],[1029,["He has said, “Hundreds.” Then I said, “Why did he give you?"]],[1032,["He should give to your driver who hasn’t got a diamond”."]],[1034,["You see, that is what it is. So it is all jugglery."]],[1038,["You should see those who materialize,"]],[1041,["what have they given you?"]],[1043,["They have to give you something eternal."]],[1045,["If they talk about God,"]],[1047,["God is not going to give you diamond."]],[1049,["Which God has given diamonds to people?"]],[1051,["Have you heard of anyone giving diamonds? No!"]],[1055,["So you should ask for something which is the highest,"]],[1059,["which is the supreme most."]],[1061,["Now the fourth thing, which is very important,"]],[1066,["that whatever experiences you get -"]],[1069,["for example, some people start just like jumping,"]],[1071,["some start shouting, some start behaving like animals."]],[1075,["And they say, “Oh, that’s what is coming out."]],[1077,["You are taking out, you see.”"]],[1078,["They feel very bad, they get horrible diseases,"]],[1082,["they get into troubles and they get into pains"]],[1084,["and all sorts of things and contortions."]],[1087,["They say, “Now, your subconscious is coming out”."]],[1089,["Nothing has to be brought out. That’s one thing you must know."]],[1092,["The subconscious, as I told you, is on the left hand side"]],[1096,["and the supraconscious on the right hand side."]],[1098,["What you have to do is to ascend in the center and come up."]],[1103,["Above your head is the super-consciousness"]],[1106,["and when you become that,"]],[1108,["then you develop collective consciousness."]],[1111,["So those who want you to become like frogs again,"]],[1115,["you must know that you are not going to become frogs anymore."]],[1119,["That’s not anyway evolution."]],[1122,["The evolution has to go higher,"]],[1125,["not becoming frogs or earthworms, you see?"]],[1128,["And if you start crawling, it is simple mesmerism."]],[1131,["Anybody mesmerizes can do these tricks, you see?"]],[1135,["It’s simple mesmerism."]],[1136,["And then to believe that now you are surrendered and all that"]],[1140,["is all nonsense, you see?"]],[1141,["It has no meaning to Realization."]],[1145,["In Realization, you just become the master."]],[1147,["You become the master of it."]],[1150,["There are many people in this country who came"]],[1153,["and lured you by their talks also,"]],[1156,["talking big about Brahma, Atmatattva, this, that and everything."]],[1161,["That is not the way you can,"]],[1163,["that is what is just the pendulum moving"]],[1166,["from Christian sermon to Hindu sermon"]],[1169,["and from Hindu sermon to Islamic sermon,"]],[1171,["from there to the Rabbi sermon."]],[1174,["You see, it goes on like that, you see? That’s not the way."]],[1177,["You have to rise higher within yourself."]],[1179,["And that’s why those who lecture about these things"]],[1181,["are really sometimes can be very, very dangerous."]],[1184,["And so many have died of cancer, this, that."]],[1188,["I don’t know what to say that people who go to these people"]],[1191,["get into very bad troubles and suffer so much."]],[1194,["And then on top of that when all this happens,"]],[1197,["they say, “You must suffer.”"]],[1200,["That’s a very good excuse, “You must suffer”."]],[1202,["You must pay to suffer."]],[1204,["Pay money to suffer."]],[1207,["And then people go on suffering."]],[1209,["Now one thing I have to tell you that Christ has suffered for us."]],[1213,["We don’t have to suffer anymore."]],[1215,["Those who deny His sufferings, will have to go for suffering."]],[1218,["All right, have it! But He suffered for us."]],[1221,["There is no need for us to suffer anymore."]],[1224,["When He is awakened within us,"]],[1226,["He takes away all that is our ego means our karmas,"]],[1229,["our superego, that is our conditioning, completely removed,"]],[1233,["and you become one with the Divine."]],[1235,["There is no need for anybody to suffer"]],[1238,["and this idea of suffering is all nonsensical."]],[1241,["You should not suffer at all."]],[1244,["Good!"]],[1247,["I’m glad it’s over."]],[1252,["- Mataji, You are called “Mother”.","- Yes."]],[1255,["It seems that in Hindu tradition"]],[1258,["there is a special context or meaning of the word “Mother”."]],[1262,["What is this meaning?"]],[1264,["You see, in the Indian philosophy,"]],[1268,["even in the Christian philosophy it is so,"]],[1271,["but it has been little bit changed -"]],[1274,["if you read the books of Essenes, you will find"]],[1276,["that they have described the “Mother”,"]],[1278,["you see, the Holy Ghost is the Mother."]],[1280,["When they say about the Holy Ghost, She is the Mother."]],[1283,["But how can you have… You must reason it out."]],[1285,["How can you have a Father and a Son without a Mother?"]],[1288,["It’s a, you see, simple thing like that."]],[1290,["You see, so it’s the Mother only. Holy Ghost is very important."]],[1294,["So Holy Ghost is the Mother."]],[1296,["You see, it's an absurd thing, I mean, to have such a thing."]],[1298,["Even homosexuals cannot have children."]],[1301,["It’s funny thing, isn’t it? Absolutely absurd!"]],[1303,["But Christians accepted this, I don’t know why."]],[1306,["Why didn’t they go into, find out"]],[1308,["what is this Holy Ghost business is?"]],[1310,["They said, “It’s a mystery”. How can you say it’s a mystery?"]],[1312,["When you cannot explain then better not say anything about it."]],[1316,["So Holy Ghost is something hanging in the air."]],[1318,["No one knows; it’s a mystery"]],[1320,["and the rest of it is the Father and the Son. It’s absurd!"]],[1323,["Now the principle of Mother is in every, every Scripture,"]],[1328,["has to be there."]],[1329,["Now the Mother’s character is that"]],[1332,["She is the One Who is the Womb,"]],[1336,["She is the One Who is the Mother Earth"]],[1338,["and She is the One Who nourishes you."]],[1341,["She nourishes us, you know that."]],[1343,["And this feminine thing in every human being"]],[1348,["resides as this Kundalini as you have seen."]],[1350,["And when She rises, She gives you this new awareness"]],[1354,["which becomes compassion, which is flowing,"]],[1357,["which becomes soothing, nourishing energy of love."]],[1365,["And that’s what today people are saying feminist -"]],[1368,["all this thing and all that. That’s again a pendulum"]],[1370,["- a man becoming a woman, woman becoming man -"]],[1372,["all these problems you have had because of this."]],[1375,["But when you move spirally upward,"]],[1379,["then where do you move you become"]],[1382,["a personality full of compassion, of love,"]],[1387,["of universal understanding,"]],[1391,["through collective consciousness."]],[1393,["And then you rise up to a position"]],[1396,["where you become universally conscious."]],[1398,["So that is what should happen to you."]],[1401,["And if that happens, then we should say"]],[1404,["that your motherly qualities within you have risen."]],[1407,["And that’s what we have so far neglected."]],[1410,["You do not become a woman but you become motherly."]],[1414,["First the Father, then the Son and now the Mother! All right?"]],[1418,["What is the role of woman in this world,"]],[1422,["the role of the feminine principle?"]],[1425,["I would say, I don’t say that women"]],[1427,["as women who are born as women only have the role,"]],[1430,["even the men have, everyone has,"]],[1432,["because everyone has Kundalini within them."]],[1434,["But the women must know that if they are women,"]],[1437,["they have a greater responsibility."]],[1440,["Not that they should sit at home and only look after children"]],[1443,["and brood and then nag the husbands when they come home."]],[1449,["That’s not their role."]],[1450,["The role is such that they have to be forbearing."]],[1455,["Any person who is the mother"]],[1457,["has to be like the Mother Earth."]],[1460,["How much She is forbearing! How much She suffers!"]],[1463,["We dig Her out, we torture Her life"]],[1466,["still She is giving all the time;"]],[1469,["She is soothing, forgiving, bearing it out, you see."]],[1472,["Then we are doing so many sinful things,"]],[1474,["I mean, She should explode real with anger, the way it is."]],[1477,["But She does not, She is very careful,"]],[1480,["She slowly, slowly informs that,"]],[1482,["“Now get out of this place, it’s rumbling”."]],[1485,["She is so kind, you see? That all should come to us."]],[1488,["So it’s not that it is only the women"]],[1491,["who should settle down with these qualities,"]],[1493,["but the time has come that men have to have these qualities."]],[1496,["Otherwise, there will be always an imbalance."]],[1498,["So now the men have to become"]],[1500,["extremely kind, affectionate, compassionate."]],[1504,["Give up that competitive spirit,"]],[1506,["that fighting spirit like Napoleon had."]],[1509,["All those ideas are outdated."]],[1511,["Now whom do you respect? People like Mahatma Gandhi"]],[1514,["or Abraham Lincoln."]],[1517,["Everyone...an American should think of Abraham Lincoln."]],[1521,["Yes, indeed."]],[1524,["Mother, what are we doing here?"]],[1526,["What is the purpose of life on earth?"]],[1528,["What are human beings walking around on this planet for?"]],[1532,["You are specially made by God."]],[1534,["You are specially chosen by God to be human beings"]],[1537,["and you are here with a very great purpose."]],[1540,["The first purpose of God"]],[1542,["is that you should become the vehicle of God’s powers,"]],[1547,["completely."]],[1548,["So that He flows through you,"]],[1550,["He flows into this atmosphere,"]],[1555,["into this universe, to make it a divine place."]],[1558,["If you, when you get Realization, what happens?"]],[1561,["These – all your abnormalities drop out"]],[1564,["and you become very normal person"]],[1566,["and these vibrations of cool breeze start flowing."]],[1570,["With this now you can give it to Mother Earth,"]],[1572,["you can give it to the plants, you can give it to the trees."]],[1575,["The whole thing becomes a “Garden of Allah”,"]],[1579,["where you reside in complete joy and happiness."]],[1582,["The second purpose is,"]],[1584,["that God has prepared you now,"]],[1586,["to settle into His Kingdom."]],[1588,["That’s your throne. That’s your right to be there."]],[1592,["It could have been short circuited"]],[1594,["at a time when Adam and Eve were called"]],[1597,["and told not to go into this so-called “book of knowledge”"]],[1602,["or the “fruit of knowledge”."]],[1604,["But they didn’t listen."]],[1605,["You see, f you give freedom to someone then, “What’s wrong?”"]],[1608,["So they started doing things which were brought to them"]],[1611,["by a satanic force and they accepted it."]],[1614,["So that was the original sin we have committed."]],[1616,["So they had to take incarnations, do all those things"]],[1619,["and now brought it to this level"]],[1622,["where human beings have to be brought again back"]],[1626,["to the position where they were to go."]],[1630,["Mother, what is the true nature of death?"]],[1633,["Is it possible that you can choose not to die?"]],[1636,["What’s the purpose of death?"]],[1638,["You see, death is just like changing your clothes."]],[1642,["So sometimes when you use too much of your clothes, get tired,"]],[1646,["you want to change it. Like that death is."]],[1649,["Nobody dies, there’s nothing that dies"]],[1651,["except that the part that is the Mother Earth"]],[1654,["and the part that is the water falls off"]],[1658,["and you remain as you are."]],[1660,["But if you are a realized soul, then you have a choice."]],[1662,["If you want to be born again, you would like to reborn."]],[1666,["If you don’t want to be born, you will not be born."]],[1668,["But after Realization, it becomes your choice."]],[1672,["If you want to die, you can die."]],[1674,["If you don’t want to die, you need not die."]],[1677,["But you want, because you think that,"]],[1682,["“Let us die and come back as new people"]],[1686,["again to help Mother.”"]],[1689,["Many of us have heard discussions or read in books"]],[1693,["about the evolution of matter, the evolution of the substance."]],[1698,["What are Your views on evolving matter"]],[1701,["and how does this relate to our own physical matter"]],[1704,["in our bodies or cells?"]],[1706,["So the matter did go into evolution, you know that,"]],[1709,["and when the carbon was established,"]],[1712,["actually our first chakra was established."]],[1714,["That’s carbon which is tetravalent and"]],[1716,["carbon is the one which started producing amino acids."]],[1720,["You see, when amino acid started manifesting itself this..."]],[1725,["then the other processes took place by which the evolution"]],[1729,["of, say from amoeba to human stage took place."]],[1734,["That also we understand very well after getting Realization,"]],[1738,["how we became from amoeba to human stage;"]],[1741,["and after human stage we have to achieve our Self Realization,"]],[1747,["means the Spirit which is in our heart,"]],[1751,["has to manifest in our attention,"]],[1754,["or we have to feel it on central nervous system."]],[1756,["But what is the relationship between matter and this?"]],[1760,["We should see that point. It’s important."]],[1762,["Now through the matter all our centers are made."]],[1765,["For example, the two centers that are down below"]],[1768,["are made of the Mother Earth principle."]],[1771,["And then another one and another one like that."]],[1774,["All these elements have contributed to make the centers."]],[1779,["And these centers are just like mirrors made"]],[1782,["and the reflection of the Divine falls on them."]],[1786,["Then at a human level the matter improves so much,"]],[1790,["goes into such evolutionary processes,"]],[1793,["that the reflection at the heart level improves so much"]],[1797,["that the Spirit shines there,"]],[1799,["and the Kundalini is properly set for your evolution,"]],[1804,["which is the epitome of evolution."]],[1806,["Like this instrument that is made one by one,"]],[1809,["first collecting this part, that part, that part,"]],[1811,["then put together."]],[1812,["Now the time has come for you to be put to the mains."]],[1816,["Now this has nothing to do with the electricity, if you see."]],[1819,["It exists without electricity but it can carry the electricity."]],[1822,["In the same way, we become the lamp,"]],[1824,["and when we become the lamp the light can be brought in"]],[1827,["and we become enlightened."]],[1829,["So there is a big relationship between the lamp and the light."]],[1834,["But light cannot exist without the lamp,"]],[1837,["so lamp has to be there."]],[1839,["Mother, can I ask you a question about sex?"]],[1842,["Yes, please."]],[1846,["It was stated today that sex has nothing to do with evolution"]],[1850,["the way it’s been described in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1852,["What does this mean?"]],[1853,["You see the thing is that we think that by doing sex"]],[1857,["or by going into sex we can evolve."]],[1859,["It’s absolutely falsehood."]],[1861,["You have not become a human being from amoeba to this stage"]],[1865,["by doing sex."]],[1867,["Because animals all do sex, everybody does sex."]],[1869,["If they do it or not, makes no difference!"]],[1871,["The thing is the evolution takes place"]],[1874,["only through your seeking."]],[1876,["When you start seeking something, then only you evolve."]],[1880,["And the seeking first was for food,"]],[1883,["if you see in the animals was for food, you see."]],[1885,["Sex was spontaneous."]],[1886,["They don’t think about it; they don’t read about it;"]],[1888,["they don’t have any education about it – nothing."]],[1891,["Sex comes all spontaneously, just like your breathing, you see."]],[1894,["You don’t have to have as you have in your schools now teaching sex."]],[1897,["What is there to teach I don’t understand, I mean."]],[1900,["It is such a spontaneous thing."]],[1901,["On the contrary, the more you talk about it,"]],[1903,["the worse it becomes, you see."]],[1904,["And the more it becomes a brain thing,"]],[1907,["you cannot do sex with your brain, you see."]],[1910,["So it’s all a nonsensical thing."]],[1911,["All these things have added to your problems"]],[1914,["of impotency and all sorts of things in this country."]],[1917,["Too much thinking about sex,"]],[1919,["at the time of sex you are nowhere, you are lost."]],[1921,["So what’s the use of such a life, you see?"]],[1923,["So the people who think about sex too much"]],[1926,["are really very unnatural people, they are very unnatural."]],[1930,["To be natural is to keep it spontaneous,"]],[1933,["to live very spontaneously."]],[1934,["Of course, as an Indian lady, it is too much to speak on details"]],[1937,["but I would say that…"]],[1943,["And we are not supposed to even say the word “sex” in Indian life,"]],[1947,["you see, it’s like that, you see?"]],[1949,["But I think we are very potent people."]],[1952,["The amount of children we are producing, you can never produce"]],[1954,["even if you want to."]],[1966,["So now the thing is that"]],[1970,["as a Mother I give all sort of grace to these people,"]],[1974,["grace marks I should say,"]],[1976,["when they said that the sex can take you to Kundalini,"]],[1979,["because you know, in the beginning"]],[1981,["they must have tried something like that"]],[1984,["and they must have seen"]],[1987,["the expression of the deity"]],[1992,["which has got a trunk, you see,"]],[1995,["which is settled on this center."]],[1996,["We call it as Ganapati"]],[1998,["who actually incarnated as Christ on this earth, later on."]],[2002,["But He is the Ganapati. And there you see just a trunk"]],[2006,["and they must have misunderstood"]],[2008,["that this trunk is the Kundalini,"]],[2009,["because it has a shape like that."]],[2012,["And that’s why they might have said it,"]],[2014,["but it’s the most dangerous thing."]],[2016,["If you go through sex,"]],[2017,["then you are open yourself absolutely to hell."]],[2022,["If you go towards sex and try to come to God,"]],[2025,["it’s absolutely wrong, you see?"]],[2028,["Christ has gone to such a limit because Christ was born here"]],[2031,["and He looks after our all optic lobes"]],[2034,["and all this part of the eyes."]],[2036,["And what He said,"]],[2038,["“Thou shalt not have adulterous eyes”."]],[2041,["Just see it!"]],[2043,["What does that mean? That means you have innocent eyes."]],[2047,["He was innocence. He was the embodiment of innocence."]],[2050,["“Thou shalt not have adulterous eyes”"]],[2052,["No lust and no greed in your eyes."]],[2055,["Now is only possible if Christ is awakened within you."]],[2058,["Once He is awakened within you,"]],[2060,["then you will have your innocence"]],[2062,["and you will also lose the lust from your eyes."]],[2065,["Eyes will be absolutely looking"]],[2068,["but not getting involved."]],[2070,["That sort of a thing will happen to you."]],[2072,["So the sex which is a normal thing to do"]],[2076,["has to be sanctified by collective people,"]],[2080,["should be done in a proper way"]],[2081,["so that you get good children."]],[2083,["The marriage should be sanctified collectively"]],[2086,["and should be done in a proper way"]],[2089,["and should be looked after."]],[2090,["Because now, of course people are on a different line,"]],[2094,["but when I had come ten years back, when I told them,"]],[2096,["that you have to have sanity about sex,"]],[2099,["they were very angry and they said, “You are Victorian”."]],[2102,["They called Me “Queen Victoria”."]],[2106,["But now I think they have learnt a lesson"]],[2108,["because I had told them, I had told them"]],[2111,["that, “You will get a disease which you will not be able to work on."]],[2115,["Don’t do all this nonsense of perversion. It’s very nonsensical.”"]],[2118,["But even now they are trying to evade the issue."]],[2120,["Don’t try to evade the issue."]],[2122,["You can be cured of that disease"]],[2124,["if you can awaken your innocence within yourself."]],[2128,["Through the grace of Christ only you can do it."]],[2131,["Mother, we have learned, heard that when,"]],[2135,["when we learn love then we shall have will."]],[2139,["What is the relationship between love and will?"]],[2144,["When we’ll have love, then we’ll have will."]],[2148,["Good! Love is when you become the Spirit,"]],[2152,["because Spirit is nothing but God’s love."]],[2154,["This All Pervading Power is Spirit."]],[2157,["So when you know that love, which is not attachment,"]],[2162,["it’s not attachment, you see."]],[2163,["Like a sap rises in the tree,"]],[2167,["it goes even to the trunk,"]],[2171,["and then to the branches, to the leaves,"]],[2174,["to the flowers, to everyone."]],[2176,["It doesn’t settle down into one flower."]],[2178,["If it does, then the flower dies and the tree also dies."]],[2182,["So it is not attached, but it is nourishing."]],[2186,["It does what it has to do. That kind of a love,"]],[2189,["which is absolutely without any conditions, unconditional,"]],[2194,["without any lust, without any greed - that kind of a love -"]],[2197,["when you will know,"]],[2198,["that is only possible when you will become the Spirit."]],[2202,["Then you will know the Will of God,"]],[2205,["the Will of God – what is to be done."]],[2207,["Because you don’t know. Now you have to..."]],[2209,["Then when you get your Realization what happens?"]],[2212,["This cool breeze is like a computer working."]],[2215,["You ask the computer, “Now, should I do this work?”"]],[2219,["If it is yes, you will have cool vibrations."]],[2222,["If not, no vibrations. So you will know His Will."]],[2226,["\"Thy Will be done\", you see? How do you know His Will?"]],[2229,["Then you just know. You become the knowledge."]],[2231,["When you become the knowledge, when you become the love,"]],[2234,["then you become the knowledge also."]],[2236,["Even in everyday life,"]],[2238,["if you love somebody, you know a lot about that person."]],[2242,["Mother, this afternoon You said something very interesting"]],[2245,["in response to a question by a woman."]],[2248,["And response You gave was that"]],[2250,["“Service and sacrifice are a myth, or is a myth.”"]],[2255,["Can you describe what You meant by that?"]],[2258,["You see, when I said that, when you become a saint,"]],[2261,["in the sense when you become a realized soul,"]],[2263,["you find that you are collectively conscious."]],[2266,["Then what happens, that if somebody has got a problem"]],[2270,["you feel it on your fingertips."]],[2272,["Now you rub your fingertips and the person feels all right."]],[2275,["Now you have done no service, you have done no sacrifice."]],[2278,["It’s your finger that is in trouble."]],[2280,["Now if you rub your finger, who is the other?"]],[2283,["You see this comes out of ignorance and those…"]],[2286,["In India actually, they knew it so well"]],[2288,["that those people who talked of sacrifice and service"]],[2292,["were called as Shudras, means untouchables."]],[2295,["That means they had no knowledge about it."]],[2297,["Those people who talked that, “We’ll serve you;"]],[2300,["we’ll do this dirty work of yours, that dirty work of yours” -"]],[2303,["they were called as Shudras."]],[2304,["They are not the people who should be touched"]],[2306,["because they have no awareness"]],[2308,["that the All Pervading Power of God is there"]],[2313,["which does everything."]],[2314,["What you have to do is to just become one with It."]],[2317,["And once you are one with the whole Primordial Being,"]],[2319,["say, on your body if there is a pain somewhere,"]],[2323,["you just rub it. All right, you rub it and it’s all right."]],[2325,["There’s no obligation on it."]],[2327,["In anyway you have not served anyone,"]],[2329,["you have not obliged anyone."]],[2330,["So the concept that you are one with the Whole itself"]],[2335,["is the noble’s concept."]],[2337,["And those people who do not have that concept"]],[2339,["cannot understand. They think,"]],[2340,["“We are serving others; we are looking after others.”"]],[2343,["“Who is the other?” I asked them. “Who is the other?”"]],[2348,["That is why this is the concept"]],[2350,["with which Indians have always lived."]],[2352,["And that’s something good they have."]],[2354,["But they also picked up, you see,"]],[2356,["when your missionaries went there"]],[2357,["they also started their missions, this, that,"]],[2360,["serving and serving and all that."]],[2362,["Now to the poor people, now how do we serve?"]],[2366,["We serve in this way in Sahaja Yoga"]],[2368,["that once they get their Realization"]],[2370,["they don’t remain so poor at all."]],[2371,["You see, because first of all"]],[2373,["the poor people have bad habits of drinking;"]],[2376,["all those things drop out."]],[2377,["So all that money doesn’t go into nonsensical thing."]],[2381,["Secondly, they get those vibrations."]],[2384,["Now whatever work they are in, they become dynamic."]],[2388,["They have no health problem."]],[2390,["They don’t have to go to the doctors."]],[2392,["They become healthy people."]],[2394,["Mentally they are so alert"]],[2396,["that they do better than any other."]],[2398,["We have seen people who came to Me and said that,"]],[2401,["“Our children are very bad at school."]],[2404,["Must do something about them.”"]],[2405,["When they got their Realization, now they stood first."]],[2407,["They got all the scholarships, everything."]],[2409,["They are doing so well."]],[2410,["So, such people become also materially better off."]],[2414,["They don’t become extraordinarily rich"]],[2417,["but they become materially well-off, satisfied people."]],[2421,["You see, also dissatisfaction is another poverty,"]],[2424,["because you are dissatisfied."]],[2425,["I think those are the greatest poor people"]],[2427,["because they are never satisfied."]],[2429,["But the people who are realized souls, are satisfied souls."]],[2435,["They know how to live well and they are helped."]],[2438,["Like Krishna has said it, “Yoga kshema Vahamyaham”."]],[2441,["He said, “I’ll give you Kshema after Yoga.”"]],[2444,["First He said “Yog.” And “Kshema” means your well-being."]],[2448,["So well-being acts after Yoga, not before."]],[2455,["Mother, in the West there is a great,"]],[2457,["especially I would say in this part of the West from the West Coast,"]],[2461,["there is a great interest in subjects such as Kabbalah,"]],[2465,["tarot, astrology, spiritual alchemy."]],[2470,["How does Sahaja Yoga relate to this? What are Your views about this?"]],[2474,["I can’t understand. That means they are not seekers"]],[2476,["those who have such interest, you see,"]],[2478,["because these things relate to a material life."]],[2480,["Mataji, how do they relate to a material life?"]],[2482,["You see, because Kabbalah will tell you when will you get married,"]],[2485,["or how much money you’ll have, what race you’ll win,"]],[2488,["all those things, you see?"]],[2489,["God has no interest in these things, you see."]],[2491,["All these things are, spiritual alchemy,"]],[2494,["how will you change this into gold..."]],[2498,["And what does it matter?"]],[2499,["Gold and all those things what are so important, isn’t it?"]],[2502,["The most important thing is to be your Spirit."]],[2507,["And those who are seeking the Spirit are real seekers."]],[2510,["All others are seeking money"]],[2513,["in some other form, you see,"]],[2515,["and then when they go to these people actually"]],[2517,["these are nothing but spirits -"]],[2518,["and they get possessed by spirits"]],[2520,["and they have horrible time, you see."]],[2522,["One should never indulge into these things."]],[2524,["Christ has warned the most of all and we are doing it."]],[2527,["So often it’s very wrong to ask"]],[2530,["for anything material like that."]],[2531,["Why should we have easy money like that?"]],[2534,["It’s not good I think,"]],[2535,["through some spirit helping you or something."]],[2537,["I don’t know if it really helps."]],[2539,["It may little bit help but give you later trouble."]],[2542,["Like one lady had a problem with her husband, you see?"]],[2546,["She said that, “He is a bad man; he’s a flirt and all that.”"]],[2550,["She went to such a woman and he became"]],[2553,["as far as she is concerned, he gave up flirting"]],[2555,["but he started racing."]],[2556,["And he got lost in racing. Then she went there and she said that,"]],[2560,["“Now he should be all right from this, He should get out.”"]],[2563,["So he started drinking."]],[2564,["And after some time he started doing all the three things, you see."]],[2567,["So it was too much."]],[2569,["So this kind of a nonsense you should not indulge into"]],[2572,["if you are seekers."]],[2574,["But there are category of people who are seekers."]],[2576,["That’s what I feel. And those who are seekers are getting into it"]],[2579,["should get out of it and get to your Spirit."]],[2583,["What’s the role of the artist"]],[2585,["- in this work, this Sahaja Yoga?","- Who?"]],[2588,["An artist, artistic work like music…"]],[2591,["Oh, great, great! Tremendous it is!"]],[2594,["You see, those people who have been realized souls"]],[2597,["have created eternal art."]],[2599,["Like we can say, Michelangelo was a realized soul."]],[2603,["So his work is eternal art."]],[2605,["They produce art which creates vibrations."]],[2608,["You can feel vibrations from him."]],[2610,["In the whole church if you go you feel horrid,"]],[2613,["but when you go to Sistine Chapel and see his work"]],[2616,["and the whole thing fills you up with vibrations."]],[2618,["They are creators of vibrations. Imagine!"]],[2621,["The musicians like Mozart..."]],[2622,["Mozart creates vibrations but Wagner…"]],[2629,["You see, so they are the people who are realized souls."]],[2633,["You have some tennis players who are realized souls also"]],[2637,["- perhaps you don't know.","- Tennis players?"]],[2638,["Yes! McEnroe is a realized soul"]],[2641,["and Borg is also."]],[2643,["And My grandchild told Me, “You know, why Borg has retired?"]],[2647,["Because another Sahaja Yogi has come now,"]],[2650,["the younger one, so give chance to him"]],[2652,["and that’s why he is very honorably retired”."]],[2655,["Is because when McEnroe speaks, you must have seen,"]],[2658,["he tells himself “John, now behave yourself.”"]],[2660,["They are in the third person."]],[2662,["And that’s why people don’t understand him"]],[2664,["and he doesn’t like to be insulted."]],[2666,["And that’s very true. And anybody who is a saint"]],[2669,["doesn’t like him to be insulted."]],[2670,["So like that you have so many people","who are realized souls, we can say."]],[2674,["Even the Princess of Wales [Diana] is a realized soul"]],[2678,["and the new child is a realized soul."]],[2680,["So there are so many people like that, who are realized souls."]],[2684,["The listeners who will be tuning into this program on the radio,"]],[2688,["won’t have had the experience of being in Your presence."]],[2691,["Some of them may have who were in this room."]],[2693,["What can you say to them about how to become a realized soul,"]],[2697,["how to achieve this cool breeze that comes from…"]],[2701,["At the beginning of My lecture,"]],[2703,["if you tell them that they should put their hands towards the radio,"]],[2706,["just on the radio,"]],[2708,["they might feel the cool breeze."]],[2710,["If they don’t feel it, then tell them to put the right hand first"]],[2713,["till they feel the cool breeze,"]],[2715,["and left hand up as if ventilating out."]],[2717,["And then the left hand towards the radio"]],[2720,["and the right hand up."]],[2722,["It might work out because it has worked in Hong Kong."]],[2726,["I tell You it would be interesting."]],[2728,["I interviewed Danny and Doug before You came"]],[2731,["so that listeners would have a chance to come here."]],[2734,["And one of them called me"]],[2735,["and said that he went into a meditation in the afternoon"]],[2738,["and felt the cool breeze just by hearing them talk."]],[2741,["See, if Sahaja Yogis can do it"]],[2743,["then when I’m talking it should happen."]],[2751,["We are about at the end of the interview"]],[2754,["and what I want to do now, Mother, is give You a chance"]],[2756,["to say what’s in Your heart to say."]],[2759,["What is there that You wish to share"]],[2761,["has not been said this evening?"]],[2764,["I have to say that America is a great country in the universe."]],[2768,["It has the place of the Vishuddhi Chakra,"]],[2771,["which is the center of responsibility and discretion."]],[2777,["And they have been so responsible so far."]],[2780,["They have given such noble ideas of democracy"]],[2783,["and of freedom and all those things"]],[2786,["which are really all belonging to God’s ideas."]],[2791,["And when they talk of all these things,"]],[2794,["we must know that there is something much more"]],[2797,["that they can give to the whole world."]],[2799,["So many saints are born in this country because they realized"]],[2803,["that this is the country where they’ll be able"]],[2805,["to prosper better into their spirituality."]],[2808,["So it is a very great responsibility of Americans"]],[2811,["to understand that we have had great leaders,"]],[2814,["we have had great noble ideals,"]],[2816,["we have had got great saints living here,"]],[2818,["so many are anxious to come down here."]],[2821,["Only thing what we have to do"]],[2823,["is to establish within ourselves our Spirit,"]],[2826,["and to be ready and prepared for this great, tremendous work"]],[2830,["that is going to come now."]],[2831,["And this is what the world has to do."]],[2834,["If emancipation of the humanity has to take place,"]],[2838,["it has to take place only from inside out and not outside in."]],[2842,["Another thing I would like to tell"]],[2844,["that the danger is not from outside for America,"]],[2848,["not from anywhere else. It is from within themselves."]],[2851,["So be careful. We have to be careful about ourselves"]],[2855,["the way we are destroying."]],[2857,["When we say, “What’s wrong?”"]],[2858,["we go head long into our destructions."]],[2861,["Human beings should not take freedom as abandonment,"]],[2864,["but freedom to enjoy completely and fully."]],[2869,["The freedom that takes you to a destruction is not freedom."]],[2873,["And the right idea of freedom must be taken"]],[2875,["and people should know that freedom,"]],[2878,["ultimate freedom, is when you become your own master,"]],[2882,["when there are no habits,"]],[2885,["when you cannot be dominated by anything,"]],[2888,["you are above everything. That’s the freedom you have to achieve."]],[2891,["And that is why"]],[2892,["people talked long time back in this country about freedom."]],[2895,["They helped all the countries to get their freedom,"]],[2898,["and now it is their job"]],[2900,["to get them their own freedom within themselves"]],[2904,["so that others will also follow."]],[2906,["May God bless you all."]],[2907,["Thank you, Mother."]],[2909,["May God bless you."]],[2919,["Good? All right."]],[2943,["Now, that was really nice of her to give so much time."]],[2946,["You see, it's important,"]],[2947,["because your medias are also for Sahaja Yoga only created."]],[2951,["Everything is for Sahaja Yoga."]],[2953,["They have to act for Sahaja Yoga only,"]],[2955,["because this has to spread everywhere."]],[2957,["Christ could not have met the whole world, you see?"]],[2959,["But I can."]]]);
